- the changed integration binaries by name. `cli_verify` is in it: the fake's screens change (verification-harness.md
  2026-11-17). `cli_send` holds the nothing-sent case, `contract_ledger_probes` and `cli_version_gate` read the
  stamps, and `rig_rehearsal` holds the two new arms' rehearsals;

- Spec anchors (rows files read by search: the seven rows files sum past 250 000 B):
  - architecture · `decision/capability-ledger`, `decision/screen-signatures-compiled`,
    `decision/version-verified-all-relied-rows`, `decision/verify-never-types-into-dialog`,
    `decision/partial-gate-on-unverified-cli`, `decision/claude-first-no-adapter-trait`, `contract/ledger-stamps/rows`,
    `contract/ledger-stamps/first-screen`, `contract/viola-verify-output/step-line`,
    `contract/viola-verify-output/summary-line`;
  - security-plan · `decision/compiled-classification-sources`, `decision/input-box-readiness-from-literals`,
    `decision/verify-writes-no-dialog-byte`, `decision/live-rig-seed-from-bundle-logic`,
    `decision/live-rig-isolated-child`, `decision/live-rig-credentials-copy`, `decision/live-round-rig-keys-own-pty`;
  - test-plan · `decision/version-gate-needs-all-relied-rows`, `decision/standing-live-rig`,
    `contract/fake-agent-cli/argv-only-options`, `contract/fake-agent-screens/trust-dialog`,
    `contract/verify-output/step-line`, `contract/verify-output/summary-line`;
  - obs-plan · `contract/verify-stdout/step-line`, `contract/verify-stdout/summary-line`;
  - design-system · `contract/viola-verify-output/step-line`, `contract/viola-verify-output/summary`;
  - layout-templates · `contract/viola-verify-output/step-line`, `contract/viola-verify-output/summary`;
  - a11y-plan · `contract/send-refusal/input-not-ready`, `decision/no-screen-content-parsing`.

- Standing lists kept:
  - tests S1–S5: own home, test-owned user home, naming, literal oracles, synthetic fixtures, tied spawns;
  - security S1–S3: own home, test-only seam under `fake-agent`, no committed fixture;
  - arch S1–S5: no live claude in CI tests, the 12 s bound, lints, no log line;
  - obs S3–S5: no sleep waits, no new log line, synthetic screens;
  - design S1–S2 and layouts S1: ASCII step line, stdout only;
  - a11y S1–S3: inside existing suites, deterministic, sequenced on records.

- Research files inspected: research §Files inspected (14 reads), plus at P4 `crates/viola-agent-claude/src/ledger.rs`
  `:20-160`, `:590-700`, `:1030-1300`; `crates/viola-agent-claude/src/screen.rs` `:30-130`, `:195-225`;
  `src/cmd/verify.rs` `:280-310`, `:430-460`; `crates/viola-e2e/src/rig/mod.rs` `:1-200`, `:340-400`, `:590-680`,
  `:725-775`, `:1090-1200`; `crates/viola-e2e/src/rig/isolate.rs` `:285-335`, `:520-540`;
  `src/bin/viola-fake-agent.rs` `:85-200`, `:970-1045`; `tests/cli_send.rs` `:1190-1232`;
  `tests/cli_verify/runs.rs` `:455-520`; the prior chunk's plan §Test Commands.

- Graph impact (research §Graph impact):
  - `SIGNATURES` @ `crates/viola-agent-claude/src/screen.rs:50`: 10 files reached by value;
  - `FirstScreen` @ `screen.rs:200`: 36 refs;
  - `LedgerRow` @ `ledger.rs:24`: 193 refs;
  - `relied` @ `ledger.rs:143`: 9 refs.

  No public signature changes, beyond `row_word` made public and `counts` added.

